d98ad8395d394"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "评价：瑕不掩瑜\r\n\r\n论可拓展性那就是没有，没有创意工坊和第三方地图等mod；论价格，原价本体加DLC够买十几个L4D。\r\n但得分点主要在游戏内容上，可以狭隘的理解为L4D的高清版本，但在这个玩法基础上增加了武器配件、卡牌的元素，尤其是卡牌的存在，让你每一把的B4B都有不一样的手感。\r\n\r\n购买建议：原价购买不值得，建议等史低入手本体加DLC。", "timestamp_created": 1734272025, "timestamp_updated": 1734272025, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "182811340", "author": {"steamid": "76561198993232774", "personaname": "SLEEPY DREAMR", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198993232774/", "num_games_owned": 26, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 91, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 91, "last_played": 1720315794, "avatar": "0a3d8e0afcc62de2a61fa5164388f765a43bc087"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "真的垃圾，一堆又臭又多的设定一开始就糊你脸上，游戏的引导提示做得非常非常差劲，有时候你莫名其妙就不知道触发了什么坏的东西导致你通关不下去，导致游戏体验非常差劲，我根本就没有想继续玩下去的动力，打击感轻飘飘的随随便便的远不如求生之路1和2，妈蛋早知道不在淘宝上买激活码了，根本退不了款，库里面就放了一个垃圾", "timestamp_created": 1734266308, "timestamp_updated": 1734266308, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "182799492", "author": {"steamid": "76561199230436953", "personaname": "breaking", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199230436953/", "num_games_owned": 23, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 2763, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1509, "last_played": 1738576770, "avatar": "fe639691663abb66576bc5ed99ecff8c8296e8fe"}, "language": "schinese", "revi